---
---

<section class="py-20 bg-[#FBF9F5] border-t border-stone-200/80 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Store Image with warm soft shadow -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 relative group">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-stone-200/90 shadow-xl bg-white">
          <img
            src="/images/kutuda-makarna-sube-konsepti.jpg"
            alt="Kutuda Makarna Gece Aydınlatmalı Şube Konsepti ve Kiosk Mimarisi"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-102 transition duration-700"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            width="1000"
            height="667"
          />

          <!-- Overlay Badge -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl p-4 flex items-center justify-between shadow-md">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
              <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-black text-[#1C1917] uppercase tracking-wider">Otantik Şube Atmosferi</div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-[#B45309] font-bold">Sıcak Ahşap & Neon Aydınlatma</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/subeler"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#FFB800] text-[#1C1917] text-xs font-black hover:bg-[#F59E0B] transition-colors"
            >
              Şubeleri Gez →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Pitch -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-[#B45309] text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>✨ Modern Fast-Casual Konsept</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#1C1917] tracking-tight font-sans leading-tight">
          "HAYAT KISA, <br />
          <span class="text-[#D97706]">MAKARNA İYİ GELİR!"</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Samsun sokaklarında yükselen taze fesleğen ve tereyağı kokusu tesadüf değil. Kutuda Makarna şubeleri, modern ahşap çıtaları, sıcak amber aydınlatması ve açık mutfak canlı pişirme konseptiyle tasarlandı.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-700">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-[#B45309] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Açık Mutfak:</strong> Siparişiniz gözünüzün önünde 3 dakikada tavada bağlanır.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-[#B45309] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black">✓</span>
            <span><strong>İster Masada, İster Yolda:</strong> Konforlu teras oturma alanı veya pratik gel-al.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-[#B45309] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black">✓</span>
            <span><strong>Gece Lezzeti:</strong> Hafta sonu gece 01:00'e kadar açık sıcak servis.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/subeler"
            class="text-[#D97706] hover:text-amber-700 font-bold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-2 group"
          >
            <span>Şubelerimizi ve Menüyü Keşfet</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
